From 103517edd18ccc2a4899524225e818fc83d34ca9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: taisei-sim rebuild <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:58:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libtaisei_sim: headless externally-stepped simulation library
 (taisei-sim ABI v1 reconstruction)

Reconstructs the taisei-sim ABI v1 consumed by touhou_Taisei_rl
(my_test/native_rl/taisei_ffi.py) on top of public Taisei.

- src/sim: libtaisei_sim.so (init/create/reset/step/get_state/save_replay)
- src/sim_hooks.{c,h}: inert unless enabled by libtaisei_sim (virtual keyboard,
  seed override, no game-over menu, instant dialogue waits)
- main.c: TAISEI_SIM_SKIP_DIALOG_WAITS=1 lets the executable verify sim replays
---
